---
// Beispielseite „Modern“: Coworking-Space – dunkel, Glas, Farbverlauf, Leuchten (rein dekorativ)
---

<div class="demo demo--modern">
  <span class="cw-orb cw-orb--a"></span>
  <span class="cw-orb cw-orb--b"></span>

  <div class="cw-nav">
    <span class="cw-logo"><i></i>werkhalle</span>
    <span class="cw-links"><span>Räume</span><span>Mitgliedschaft</span><span>Events</span><span>Kontakt</span></span>
    <span class="cw-pill">Probetag buchen</span>
    <span class="cw-burger"><i></i><i></i></span>
  </div>

  <div class="cw-hero">
    <div class="cw-copy">
      <span class="cw-chip"><i></i>12 Plätze heute frei</span>
      <p class="cw-title">Arbeiten, wo Ideen <span>wachsen.</span></p>
      <p class="cw-text">Flexible Schreibtische, ruhige Telefonboxen und Kaffee ohne Ende – mitten in Magdeburg.</p>
      <span class="cw-actions">
        <span class="cw-btn">Probetag buchen →</span>
        <span class="cw-ghost">Räume ansehen</span>
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="cw-widget">
      <span class="cw-widget__head">Heute · Donnerstag</span>
      <span class="cw-row">
        <span>Flex Desk</span><b>12 frei</b>
        <span class="cw-bar"><i></i></span>
      </span>
      <span class="cw-row">
        <span>Meetingraum „Elbe“</span><b>ab 14 Uhr</b>
        <span class="cw-bar cw-bar--half"><i></i></span>
      </span>
      <span class="cw-row">
        <span>Telefonbox</span><b>frei</b>
        <span class="cw-bar cw-bar--low"><i></i></span>
      </span>
      <span class="cw-widget__btn">Platz reservieren</span>
      <span class="cw-float">☕ Kaffee-Flat inklusive</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cw-stats">
    <span><b>180 m²</b>Fläche</span>
    <span><b>40</b>Arbeitsplätze</span>
    <span><b>24/7</b>Zugang</span>
    <span><b>1 Gbit</b>Glasfaser</span>
  </div>
</div>
